{"3240250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AutoBlobber", "steam_appid": 3240250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>AutoBlobber</i>, where your strategic skills will be put to the ultimate test!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>AutoBlobber</i>, strategy is everything. You won’t control movement or combat. Instead, you’ll guide your Blob through wave after wave of enemies by choosing and placing upgrades between each round. Build powerful synergies, unlock enchantments, and evolve your Blob into an unstoppable force — then sit back and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive as long as you can and rise on the global leaderboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Upgrades Between Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unique upgrades with different abilities and target modes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Battle countless enemies with increasing difficulty per wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Upgrades Into Stronger Versions</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/592082766e01a68568ba79162ac17d38.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/592082766e01a68568ba79162ac17d38.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/592082766e01a68568ba79162ac17d38.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your simple Upgrades into stronger versions of themselves, with 3 different tiers of each upgrade variant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/1adb226e966acf6468e368ac147dbefd.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/1adb226e966acf6468e368ac147dbefd.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/1adb226e966acf6468e368ac147dbefd.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your Blob can handle Bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Improve Existing Upgrades With Improvement Upgrades</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/76fa3884bc43fc7c6e61f60c9ec8e9de.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/76fa3884bc43fc7c6e61f60c9ec8e9de.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/76fa3884bc43fc7c6e61f60c9ec8e9de.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve all upgrades of one variant with<i> &quot;improvement-upgrades&quot;</i> that enhance the stats of all currently equipped upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increase Your &quot;Blob-Army&quot; And See How Many Waves You Can Survive</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/6d7bdb5df891a23637011d532ea12486.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/6d7bdb5df891a23637011d532ea12486.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/6d7bdb5df891a23637011d532ea12486.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue to play, grow, battle, and purchase new upgrades, and see how many waves you can last.   <br><br><i>A <u>Global</u> Leaderboard will display who the best<strong> AutoBlobber is</strong></i>.  <br><br><strong>Will you be the best?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>AutoBlobber</i>, where your strategic skills will be put to the ultimate test!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>AutoBlobber</i>, strategy is everything. You won’t control movement or combat. Instead, you’ll guide your Blob through wave after wave of enemies by choosing and placing upgrades between each round. Build powerful synergies, unlock enchantments, and evolve your Blob into an unstoppable force — then sit back and watch the chaos unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive as long as you can and rise on the global leaderboard.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip Upgrades Between Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/bd9a187fba02af323bdac8fa68798711.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unique upgrades with different abilities and target modes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.poster.avif?t=1784921544\" width=608 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.webm?t=1784921544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/5e3435881d7853237486357f52111cfd.mp4?t=1784921544\" type=\"v